M        EQU   3
N        EQU   2
U        EQU   1000
V        EQU   1010
W        EQU   1020
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  M-1       M1. Initialize.
         JOV   OFLO      Ensure that overflow is off.
         STZ   W,1       wrI1 ← 0.
         DEC1  1
         J1NN  *-2       Repeat for m > rI1 ≥ 0.
         ENN2  N         j ← 0.
1H       LDX   V+N,2     M2. Zero multiplier?
         JXZ   8F        If vj = 0, set wj+m ← 0 and go to M6.
         ENN1  M         M3. Initialize i. i ← 0.
         ENT3  N,2       (i + j) ← j.
         ENTX  0         k ← 0.
2H       STX   CARRY     M4. Multiply and add.
         LDA   U+M,1
         MUL   V+N,2     rAX ← ui × vj.
         SLC   5         Interchange rA ↔ rX.
         ADD   W,3       Add wi+j to lower half.
         JNOV  *+2       Did overflow occur?
         INCX  1         If so, carry 1 into upper half.
         ADD   CARRY     Add k to lower half.
         JNOV  *+2       Did overflow occur?
         INCX  1         If so, carry 1 into upper half.
         STA   W,3       wi+j ← t mod b.
         INC1  1         M5. Loop on i. i ← i + 1.
         INC3  1         (i + j) ← (i + j) + 1.
         J1N   2B        Back to M4 with rX = ⌊t/b⌋ if i < m.
8H       STX   W+M+N,2   Set wj+m ← rX.
         INC2  1         M6. Loop on j. j ← j + 1.
         J2N   1B        Repeat until j = n.
         HLT
OFLO     HLT   1
CARRY    CON   0
         END   START
